remediation:
Replace `headers.get(header::CONNECTION)` with `headers.get_all(header::CONNECTION)` and iterate over ALL Connection header values to strip all designated hop-by-hop headers. Example:
```rust
for values in headers.get_all(header::CONNECTION).iter() {
    if let Ok(v) = values.to_str() {
        for m in v.split(',') {
            if !m.is_empty() {
                to_remove.push(m.trim().to_string());
            }
        }
    }
}
for name in to_remove { headers.remove(&name); }
```
